(678,"VERIFIED_VERBATIM","Leaving aside the quality of the prose entirely, the sheer repetition of elements will remove the material from serious consideration.","Raw live page (curl, browser UA, HTTP 200). Quote exact. Editorial framing supported by the same paragraph: 'if you're an editor, you'll see the current AI tropes dozens of times with each new iteration.'"),
